    "detailed_description": "<h1>\u2764\ufe0f Wishlist Stuck On Earth \u2764\ufe0f</h1><p>\ud83c\udf81<strong>To receive</strong> the <strong>DAY-ONE</strong> limited edition skin, personalized and with your nickname on it, plus other exclusive bonuses and skins, each new season <u>FOREVER</u>!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.poster.avif?t=1752837310\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.webm?t=1752837310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.mp4?t=1752837310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/88e793cdd739b8bd382844daaae64758.poster.avif?t=1752837310\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/88e793cdd739b8bd382844daaae64758.webm?t=1752837310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/88e793cdd739b8bd382844daaae64758.mp4?t=1752837310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Aliens from across the universe were just trying to get on with their lives\u2014until a malfunctioning portal dropped them on Earth, shrunk and confused. Now they\u2019re stuck, surrounded by clueless humans, and the only way forward is to fight, fly, and fling balls at everything in sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some want out. Others want a second chance. But all of them are ready to cause trouble. Welcome to <strong><i>Stuck On Earth</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/4d342b8cb5cef41f4a93590cd19e58c7.webp?t=1752837310\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/b0b822d74c3d731f7b8f75e0d11eaac1.avif?t=1752837310\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>unique alien abilities</strong> to outplay opponents and score goals in oversized human environments. It\u2019s intergalactic warfare with style, strategy, and a dash of existential dread. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*New Aliens will be unveiled soon.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/4ba1d10debf22f2c31742cbc7b4e00cb.webp?t=1752837310\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/3b1c413df398e1c87eef5cfd89ee917a.poster.avif?t=1752837310\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/3b1c413df398e1c87eef5cfd89ee917a.webm?t=1752837310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/3b1c413df398e1c87eef5cfd89ee917a.mp4?t=1752837310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Once the ultimate is activated, a giant Robot is unleashed and the player can receive assistance, alter the environment, defend a location, receive a boost, and more! The Robots are collectibles that you unlock by completing quests. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/ac7f8d31fdfcf2e6b35c8e9c93d3dd0e.webp?t=1752837310\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/e8e79c819397dcd940d6b8cc33bb2f81.poster.avif?t=1752837310\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/e8e79c819397dcd940d6b8cc33bb2f81.webm?t=1752837310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/e8e79c819397dcd940d6b8cc33bb2f81.mp4?t=1752837310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore the strange world of Earth through the eyes of the stranded aliens. Meet oddball NPCs, take on their challenges, and unlock new characters with unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/54d3ab76d8b70e3a8f36d7c9a7c9c188.webp?t=1752837310\" /></span>We are a small indie studio located in the south of Switzerland with great ambition and skills. Momento Games specializes in game-as-a-service with the mission of enabling players and content creators to interact like never before through the development of innovative technology. Stuck On Earth is our debut title and a testament to the future we are building. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/8055c53c7ebff05616b29bec9dc73858.avif?t=1752837310\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/88e793cdd739b8bd382844daaae64758.poster.avif?t=1752837310\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/88e793cdd739b8bd382844daaae64758.webm?t=1752837310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/88e793cdd739b8bd382844daaae64758.mp4?t=1752837310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Aliens from across the universe were just trying to get on with their lives\u2014until a malfunctioning portal dropped them on Earth, shrunk and confused. Now they\u2019re stuck, surrounded by clueless humans, and the only way forward is to fight, fly, and fling balls at everything in sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some want out. Others want a second chance. But all of them are ready to cause trouble. Welcome to <strong><i>Stuck On Earth</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/4d342b8cb5cef41f4a93590cd19e58c7.webp?t=1752837310\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/b0b822d74c3d731f7b8f75e0d11eaac1.avif?t=1752837310\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>unique alien abilities</strong> to outplay opponents and score goals in oversized human environments. It\u2019s intergalactic warfare with style, strategy, and a dash of existential dread. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*New Aliens will be unveiled soon.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/4ba1d10debf22f2c31742cbc7b4e00cb.webp?t=1752837310\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/3b1c413df398e1c87eef5cfd89ee917a.poster.avif?t=1752837310\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/3b1c413df398e1c87eef5cfd89ee917a.webm?t=1752837310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/3b1c413df398e1c87eef5cfd89ee917a.mp4?t=1752837310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Once the ultimate is activated, a giant Robot is unleashed and the player can receive assistance, alter the environment, defend a location, receive a boost, and more! The Robots are collectibles that you unlock by completing quests. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/ac7f8d31fdfcf2e6b35c8e9c93d3dd0e.webp?t=1752837310\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/e8e79c819397dcd940d6b8cc33bb2f81.poster.avif?t=1752837310\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/e8e79c819397dcd940d6b8cc33bb2f81.webm?t=1752837310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/e8e79c819397dcd940d6b8cc33bb2f81.mp4?t=1752837310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore the strange world of Earth through the eyes of the stranded aliens. Meet oddball NPCs, take on their challenges, and unlock new characters with unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/54d3ab76d8b70e3a8f36d7c9a7c9c188.webp?t=1752837310\" /></span>We are a small indie studio located in the south of Switzerland with great ambition and skills. Momento Games specializes in game-as-a-service with the mission of enabling players and content creators to interact like never before through the development of innovative technology. Stuck On Earth is our debut title and a testament to the future we are building. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2273530/extras/8055c53c7ebff05616b29bec9dc73858.avif?t=1752837310\" /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Smash, stun, and score in this chaotic 2v2 combat baller where aliens collide! Use your unique abilities, bend the laws of physics, and dominate the domain to rise through the ranks in this competitive title to uncover why you're Stuck on Earth...",
